{"4548830":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"SCRAPBOX ","steam_appid":4548830,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD. WELD. DRIVE. SURVIVE.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SCRAPBOX<\/strong> is a physics-based sandbox game about building vehicles from whatever you can find and putting them to the test on challenging tracks.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no ready-made cars. Grab wheels, axles, frames, seats, boosters, and whatever other pieces of scrap you can get your hands on. Weld them together, figure out how to make the thing move, and hope your questionable engineering survives the road ahead.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map brings a different track and a new challenge. Build a vehicle that can handle the terrain, then drive it as far as you can. If it falls apart, learn from the wreckage, rebuild, and try again.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY YOUR WAY<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the game <strong>solo<\/strong>, team up with friends in <strong>co-op<\/strong>, or compete against other players online.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In competitive multiplayer, you can play <strong>every player for themselves<\/strong> or split into <strong>up to 4 teams<\/strong>, with <strong>1–4 players per team<\/strong>. Work together to build one machine, or prove that your pile of scrap is better than everyone else's.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PHYSICS IS PART OF THE FUN<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicles in SCRAPBOX are built and driven using physics. Weight distribution, wheel placement, suspension, construction strength, and the way you weld everything together affect how your creation behaves.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes careful engineering wins.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes a seat welded to four wheels somehow works too.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build from scrap. Weld it together. Get behind the wheel. See how far you can make it.<\/strong><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD. WELD. DRIVE. SURVIVE.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SCRAPBOX<\/strong> is a physics-based sandbox game about building vehicles from whatever you can find and putting them to the test on challenging tracks.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no ready-made cars. Grab wheels, axles, frames, seats, boosters, and whatever other pieces of scrap you can get your hands on. Weld them together, figure out how to make the thing move, and hope your questionable engineering survives the road ahead.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map brings a different track and a new challenge. Build a vehicle that can handle the terrain, then drive it as far as you can. If it falls apart, learn from the wreckage, rebuild, and try again.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY YOUR WAY<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the game <strong>solo<\/strong>, team up with friends in <strong>co-op<\/strong>, or compete against other players online.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In competitive multiplayer, you can play <strong>every player for themselves<\/strong> or split into <strong>up to 4 teams<\/strong>, with <strong>1–4 players per team<\/strong>. Work together to build one machine, or prove that your pile of scrap is better than everyone else's.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PHYSICS IS PART OF THE FUN<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicles in SCRAPBOX are built and driven using physics. Weight distribution, wheel placement, suspension, construction strength, and the way you weld everything together affect how your creation behaves.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes careful engineering wins.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes a seat welded to four wheels somehow works too.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build from scrap. Weld it together. Get behind the wheel. See how far you can make it.<\/strong><\/p>","short_description":"SCRAPBOX is a physics-based sandbox where you build vehicles from scrap, weld them together, and take on challenging tracks. Play solo, team up with friends in co-op, or compete online against other players and teams.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4548830\/f0b56f7e5c1368852c5e2f457738bb952757c4b9\/header.jpg?t=1793725216","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4548830\/1f00164372b2278b07af5b80196f7d1ada1cc3f9\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793725216","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4548830\/1f00164372b2278b07af5b80196f7d1ada1cc3f9\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793725216","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-6100 \/ AMD FX-6300<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> GTX 750 Ti \/ Radeon R7 360<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 900 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-8400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> GTX 1060 \/ RX 580<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 900 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong